76e-4471-8009-91749fde5f47?syn-25a6b1a6=1</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:52:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] Nvidia 和 A.I. 股市下跌股市抹去了周一的部分涨势</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/business/stocks-sp500-huang-nvidia.html</link><description>受英伟达事件以及 Anthropic 公开发行后股价涨跌影响，股价连续几天大幅波动。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/business/stocks-sp500-huang-nvidia.html'&gt;Nvidia 和 A.I. 股市下跌股市抹去了周一的部分涨势&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stock Markets Slip as Nvidia and A.I. Stocks Erase Some of Monday’s Rally&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/business/stocks-sp500-huang-nvidia.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:01:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC等5家] 英伟达把黄仁勋带回来了。但调查尚未结束</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/nvidia-jensen-huang-ceo-return.html</link><description>黄仁勋重新担任英伟达首席执行官，但该公司仍面临内部调查以及加州和联邦审查。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 5 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/nvidia-jensen-huang-ceo-return.html'&gt;英伟达把黄仁勋带回来了。但调查尚未结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nvidia brought Jensen Huang back. But the investigations aren’t over&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[BBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cq5y1k8ez407o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss'&gt;特朗普在表示“说服”英伟达恢复首席执行官黄仁勋后面临强烈反对&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump faces backlash after saying he 'convinced' Nvidia to reinstate CEO Jensen Huang&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[美联社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNbUdPNnFZNXVRRHJqeGNYX0ptRk1oUW85OHlueHM2aW5teGxVWmViTWdKOGVTTVBYdWNVTjA3M2d4NUFfQ1Fac2g2ZzVZZ0hMdnZ6V1RQdFRmdWNfZlFzNnRYNmR0YWsxUjFIaTNYR2c5V3RQUHdVVUx4X1loaHF6dEcyNF9fQQ?oc=5'&gt;英伟达董事会在拒绝黄仁勋回归首席执行官几天后恢复其首席执行官职务&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nvidia board reinstates Jensen Huang as CEO just days after rejecting his offer to return&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/82d3be02-8ac7-4acb-aefa-6e3722ee05cc?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;游说特朗普带回黄仁勋的“作战室”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Inside the ‘war room’ that lobbied Trump to bring back Jensen Huang&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/technology/jensen-huang-nvidia-board-trump.html'&gt;随着黄仁勋重新担任首席执行官，特朗普实际上凌驾于英伟达董事会之上&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：With Jensen Huang’s Return as C.E.O., Trump Effectively Overrode Nvidia’s Board&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/nvidia-jensen-huang-ceo-return.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:03:36 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 地中海饮食背后的科学家如何陷入特朗普对哈佛的战争</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/us/politics/walter-willett-trump-harvard.html</link><description>沃尔特·威利特（Walter Willett）研究饮食与健康之间的联系，这是卫生部长小罗伯特·F·肯尼迪（Robert F. Kennedy Jr.）的首要任务。无论如何，他的拨款都被冻结了。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/us/politics/walter-willett-trump-harvard.html'&gt;地中海饮食背后的科学家如何陷入特朗普对哈佛的战争&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：How a Scientist Behind the Mediterranean Diet Got Caught in Trump’s War on Harvard&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/us/politics/walter-willett-trump-harvard.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:04:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 巴西雷亚尔因卢拉支持进一步限制支出的报道而上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/brazil-real-rallies-on-reports-lula-backs-further-spending-curbs</link><description>有报道称，巴西总统路易斯·伊纳西奥·卢拉·达席尔瓦支持采取进一步措施遏制政府支出，缓解了人们对赤字的担忧，上个月他意外连任后，赤字拖累巴西货币大幅贬值，巴西雷亚尔创下近两个月来最大涨幅。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/brazil-real-rallies-on-reports-lula-backs-further-spending-curbs'&gt;巴西雷亚尔因卢拉支持进一步限制支出的报道而上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brazil Real Rallies on Reports Lula Backs Further Spending Curbs&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/brazil-real-rallies-on-reports-lula-backs-further-spending-curbs</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:12:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 纽约市呼吁 Kalshi 和 Polymarket 就针对青少年的营销活动作证</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/nyc-calls-on-kalshi-polymarket-to-testify-on-marketing-to-youth</link><description>纽约市立法者呼吁来自最大预测市场的高管作证，市议会正在调查这些平台是否使用欺骗性营销策略来吸引据称以不成比例的速度亏损的年轻用户。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/nyc-calls-on-kalshi-polymarket-to-testify-on-marketing-to-youth'&gt;纽约市呼吁 Kalshi 和 Polymarket 就针对青少年的营销活动作证&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：NYC Calls on Kalshi, Polymarket to Testify on Marketing to Youth&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/nyc-calls-on-kalshi-polymarket-to-testify-on-marketing-to-youth</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:21:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 电台播放俄罗斯军队的经典摇滚、怀旧之情以及投降请求</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/world/europe/ukraine-russia-psyops-radio-izium.html</link><description>看似前线的俄罗斯广播电台实际上是乌克兰的一次心理行动，希望在克里姆林宫的士兵中播下绝望的种子。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/world/europe/ukraine-russia-psyops-radio-izium.html'&gt;电台播放俄罗斯军队的经典摇滚、怀旧之情以及投降请求&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Radio Offers Russian Troops Classic Rock, Nostalgia — and Pleas to Surrender&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/world/europe/ukraine-russia-psyops-radio-izium.html